# Six Labors licence. This must never be committed: the licence is issued to one
# person or project and the key is not a shared secret, so a copy in the history
# stays readable forever even after the file is deleted in a later commit. The
# key is supplied at build time via the IMAGESHARP_LICENSE_KEY environment
# variable instead. See the "ImageSharp licence key" section of README.md.
*.lic
sixlabors.lic
# Staging file for publish-release.ps1. Release notes live on GitHub Releases;
# keeping a copy in the repo means it goes stale and ships the previous version's text.
RELEASE_BODY.md
